    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market Flannelly Auctioneers offer this spacious well-proportioned four bedroom detached  single storey residence. Built in the 1980’s, it has all the attributes a family could possibly want, with generous living space sitting on an elevated site (0.296acres) overlooking the scenic rural countryside. Close to all amenities, the property is within 10km from Castlebar town centre, 1km from Ross Stores and 4.5kms from Turlough Village which offers access onto the N5 all within 10kms from Castlebar town centre, 1km from Ross Stores and 4.5kms from Turlough village with access to N5 for transport links .\r\nThe property requires extensive re-modelling and upgrading but offers the discerning buyer a wonderful opportunity to renovate and retrofit to their own requirements and taste."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Accommodation Comprises.;\r\nEntrance hall; 4.40mx 1.80m /8.30m x 1m leading to all further accommodation.\r\nKitchen/dining area ; 8.60m x 3.40m - door to rear yard. Step down to living-room\r\nLivingroom;       4.20m x 5.80m Fireplace stone surround.\r\nBedroom 1;     3.40m x 3.80m / en-suite 1.70m x 0.8m.\r\nBedroom 2;      4.30m x 3.0m.\r\nBedroom 3;      3.10m x 7.60m \r\nBedroom 4.      3.10m x 2.50m \r\nBathroom ;       3.40 x 1.70m  \r\n\r\nInternal Garage/store/boiler house 4.20m x 9.30m \r\n\r\nDetached garage; 6m x 4.25m\r\n\r\nSecure site bounded by mix of hedging and block wall. Tarmac drive.\r\n\r\nThis property meets the criteria for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant - \r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Flannelly Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Flannelly Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
